Package: spatialPortalApi
Type: Package
Title: REST Backend for the Spatial Portal Web Application
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Spatial Portal", "Team", email = "spatial@example.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: A plumber-based REST API that ingests Vectra Polaris / VPD-style
    tumor imaging data (bundled VectraPolarisData cohorts and user-uploaded
    CSVs), computes spatial statistics (Ripley's K, Nearest Neighbour G) for
    immune cell populations, and links those summaries to survival outcomes
    via Cox proportional hazards models.
